      "options": {
        "content": "# End-to-End SLA Report Generation & Troubleshooting Dashboard\nTracks the entire SLA report lifecycle: **Request Enqueue** (`sla-report-trigger-api`) \u2192 **Worker Execution** (`sla-report-generator` / Celery) \u2192 **Parquet Export & Storage** (`sla-reports-api` / MinIO) \u2192 **Progress & Trace Polling** (`slapg` Redis) \u2192 **Data Consolidation** (DuckDB) \u2192 **PDF Generation & Storage** (`weld-data` / `report-service`). Use this dashboard to pinpoint failures, latencies, or resource bottlenecks at any stage from initial request to getting a PDF.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "10.0.0",
      "title": "Pipeline Architecture & Diagnostics Guide",
      "type": "text"
    },
